"""
CUCM RIS Port - Device Registration & IP Address Query
Compatible with CUCM 12.5 and 15

Fallback chain (automatic):
  Method 1 → Zeep Type Factory
  Method 2 → Zeep Plain Dict
  Method 3 → Raw SOAP (requests only, no Zeep)

Requirements:
    pip install zeep requests

Usage:
    1. Edit the CONFIG section below
    2. Add your device names to DEVICE_NAMES list (or load from file)
    3. Run: python cucm_ris_query.py
    4. Optional debug: python cucm_ris_query.py --debug
"""

